    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Galaxy_at_War\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War\">Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>Even as you reel from attacks, you can get yourself back into the fight and make a difference.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> 13</p><p><b>Effect:</b> When you take the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Recover\" title=\"Recover\">Recover</a> Action, you also gain a number of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Hit Points\">Bonus Hit Points</a> equal to 2 x your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> bonus (Minimum 2). Damage is subtracted from the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Hit Points\">Bonus Hit Points</a> first, and any <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Hit Points\">Bonus Hit Points</a> remaining at the end of encounter are lost. <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bonus_Hit_Points\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Hit Points\">Bonus Hit Points</a> do not stack.</p>",
